# state: any   (golden 9153c63300da promoted 2026-10-11; lane.savestate433)
# Grand Theft Auto III (5454000E): PROBE ONLY, never scored. localdrive1018
# (#433) Part D still needs real car-entry and pause-menu frames to build
# the gta3.toml crops for those two states -- gta-3.route (the title's one
# proven route) never presses Y or opens the pause menu, so it cannot
# produce them no matter how many times it is re-run (see
# docs/lanes/localdrive1018/NOTES.md, "Still not done"). This route is a
# plain press/axis/wait/shot script, same primitives gta-3.route already
# uses, with NO `drive` step -- it does not touch the unmerged gta3.toml/
# drive.py profile gate, so it can be dispatched today, before this PR
# merges.
#
# Preamble (boot -> on-foot play) is gta-3.route's own, copied verbatim so
# this reuses its already-proven timing instead of re-deriving it; the
# `fist-hud` reference crop is copied unchanged from routes/refs/gta-3/
# into this route's own refs dir (ref_path keys by route stem).
#
# Then: Y enters the car (brief step 4, confirmed by the owner's own
# hands-on walkthrough today); wait and shot. START opens the pause menu
# (gtawedge1012's route.sh comment on gta-3.route already established
# START toggles this title's pause on/off); wait and shot -- Save should
# be the default highlighted row (owner's words), captured here, not
# navigated to or pressed (no A on this menu: this run must not create or
# overwrite a save). START again closes the pause menu back to play; wait
# and shot, to also confirm Y/START left the player safely back in
# control rather than stuck on a dialog.
#
# No `mark`: this is not a scored play-share window (title_verdict.py),
# only `shot` frames for building drive-profiles/gta3.toml's remaining
# crops offline.
wait 55
repeat 4 {
    press A 300
    wait 5
}
shot introskip
repeat 12 {
    press A 300
    wait 5
}
shot pregameplay
waitfor fist-hud 60 1020,88,140,130 20
shot onfoot
wait 1
press Y 300
wait 3
shot car-entered
wait 1
press START 300
wait 2
shot pause-menu
wait 2
press START 300
wait 2
shot resumed
